title: "CARANA CBD Learning Lab"
abstract: "An offline-first, local-first interactive simulation laboratory supporting the six phases of United Nations Police (UNPOL) Capacity-Building and Development (CBD). Designed for peace operations personnel, police development advisers, and training institutions to translate peacekeeping intelligence into structured, evidence-based planning outputs."
